{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00433","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 外办将出 · 武则天","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 外办将出","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"总章陈昔典，衢室礼惟神。\n宏规则天地，神用叶陶钧。\n负扆三春旦，充庭万宇宾。\n顾己诚虚薄，空慙亿兆人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}